{"id":"43f749607d4825d4","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-chernoff-bound.md","title":"Chernoff Bound","display":"thm-chernoff-bound — Chernoff Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-chernoff-bound","aliases":["28-thm-chernoff-bound","Multiplicative Chernoff Bound"],"display":"thm-chernoff-bound — Chernoff Bound","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Theorem A.14 and Corollary A.15; printed pp.514–515; PDF pp.540–541","source_printed_pages":"514–515","source_pdf_pages":"540–541","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"source-proof-not-fully-audited; local-proof-reviewed","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"verification_status":"proved-in-note; R7","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-chernoff-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-chernoff-bound</span><span>Multiplicative Chernoff Bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-chernoff-bound — Chernoff Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem A.14 and Corollary A.15; printed pp.514–515; PDF pp.540–541"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"514–515"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"540–541"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-proof-not-fully-audited; local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; R7"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1,\\ldots,X_m\">\\(X_1,\\ldots,X_m\\)</span> 为相互独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 值随机变量，其分布可不同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\sum_{i=1}^mX_i\">\\(X=\\sum_{i=1}^mX_i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=\\mathbb E X=\\sum_i\\mathbb E X_i\">\\(\\mu=\\mathbb E X=\\sum_i\\mathbb E X_i\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in(0,1]\">\\(\\delta\\in(0,1]\\)</span>；概率、期望取同一个联合乘积分布。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(t)=e^t\">\\(\\exp(t)=e^t\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[X\\ge(1+\\delta)\\mu]\\le\\exp(-\\delta^2\\mu/3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[X\\ge(1+\\delta)\\mu]\\le\\exp(-\\delta^2\\mu/3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[X\\le(1-\\delta)\\mu]\\le\\exp(-\\delta^2\\mu/2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[X\\le(1-\\delta)\\mu]\\le\\exp(-\\delta^2\\mu/2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 历史证据边界：当时核对独立性、参数端点与标准指数界简化，未完整独立审计一般 Chernoff 证明，故当时不作为已完整核验的证明依赖。R7 另给下述有限独立比特的完整局部证明；原书只展开上尾的证明记录仍与局部证明资格分开。</p>\n<p>由定理 A.14 的精确指数界分别使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^\\delta/(1+\\delta)^{1+\\delta}\\le e^{-\\delta^2/3}\">\\(e^\\delta/(1+\\delta)^{1+\\delta}\\le e^{-\\delta^2/3}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{-\\delta}/(1-\\delta)^{1-\\delta}\\le e^{-\\delta^2/2}\">\\(e^{-\\delta}/(1-\\delta)^{1-\\delta}\\le e^{-\\delta^2/2}\\)</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=1\">\\(\\delta=1\\)</span> 的下尾取极限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=0\">\\(\\mu=0\\)</span> 时两式右侧为 1，结论仍成立。R6 只核对陈述与该标准简化，未逐行审计书中完整矩母函数证明。</p>\n<p>R7 局部证明：写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i=\\Pr[X_i=1]\">\\(p_i=\\Pr[X_i=1]\\)</span>。对任意实数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>，独立性与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1+u\\le e^u\">\\(1+u\\le e^u\\)</span> 给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E e^{tX}=\\prod_{i=1}^m(1+p_i(e^t-1))\\le\\exp(\\mu(e^t-1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb E e^{tX}=\\prod_{i=1}^m(1+p_i(e^t-1))\\le\\exp(\\mu(e^t-1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t&gt;0\">\\(t&gt;0\\)</span>，在上尾事件上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{tX}\\ge e^{t(1+\\delta)\\mu}\">\\(e^{tX}\\ge e^{t(1+\\delta)\\mu}\\)</span>，对有限概率质量求和即得其概率至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(\\mu(e^t-1)-t(1+\\delta)\\mu)\">\\(\\exp(\\mu(e^t-1)-t(1+\\delta)\\mu)\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=\\ln(1+\\delta)\">\\(t=\\ln(1+\\delta)\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(-\\mu h_+(\\delta))\">\\(\\exp(-\\mu h_+(\\delta))\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_+(u)=(1+u)\\ln(1+u)-u\">\\(h_+(u)=(1+u)\\ln(1+u)-u\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le u\\le1\">\\(0\\le u\\le1\\)</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ln(1+u)\\ge2u/(2+u)\\ge2u/3\">\\(\\ln(1+u)\\ge2u/(2+u)\\ge2u/3\\)</span>；第一不等式由两边之差在零处为零、导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^2/((1+u)(2+u)^2)\\ge0\">\\(u^2/((1+u)(2+u)^2)\\ge0\\)</span> 得到。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_+(\\delta)=\\int_0^\\delta\\ln(1+u)\\,du\\ge\\delta^2/3\">\\(h_+(\\delta)=\\int_0^\\delta\\ln(1+u)\\,du\\ge\\delta^2/3\\)</span>。\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\delta&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;\\delta&lt;1\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=\\ln(1-\\delta)&lt;0\">\\(t=\\ln(1-\\delta)&lt;0\\)</span>，在下尾事件上仍有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{tX}\\ge e^{t(1-\\delta)\\mu}\">\\(e^{tX}\\ge e^{t(1-\\delta)\\mu}\\)</span>，同一质量求和给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(-\\mu h_-(\\delta))\">\\(\\exp(-\\mu h_-(\\delta))\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_-(u)=u+(1-u)\\ln(1-u)\">\\(h_-(u)=u+(1-u)\\ln(1-u)\\)</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_-(0)=0\">\\(h_-(0)=0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_-^{\\prime}(u)=-\\ln(1-u)\\ge u\">\\(h_-^{\\prime}(u)=-\\ln(1-u)\\ge u\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_-(\\delta)\\ge\\delta^2/2\">\\(h_-(\\delta)\\ge\\delta^2/2\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=1\">\\(\\delta=1\\)</span> 时，下尾事件为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=0\">\\(X=0\\)</span>，其概率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_i(1-p_i)\\le e^{-\\mu}\\le e^{-\\mu/2}\">\\(\\prod_i(1-p_i)\\le e^{-\\mu}\\le e^{-\\mu/2}\\)</span>，无需代入未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ln0\">\\(\\ln0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=0\">\\(\\mu=0\\)</span> 时两个所列上界均为一，仍成立。全部概率均取绑定的有限乘积分布；这份证明不依赖任何尚未核验的复杂性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"X_1,\\ldots,X_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\sum_{i=1}^mX_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu=\\mathbb E X=\\sum_i\\mathbb E X_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(t)=e^t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[X\\ge(1+\\delta)\\mu]\\le\\exp(-\\delta^2\\mu/3).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr[X\\le(1-\\delta)\\mu]\\le\\exp(-\\delta^2\\mu/2).","display":true},{"tex":"e^\\delta/(1+\\delta)^{1+\\delta}\\le e^{-\\delta^2/3}","display":false},{"tex":"e^{-\\delta}/(1-\\delta)^{1-\\delta}\\le e^{-\\delta^2/2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu=0","display":false},{"tex":"p_i=\\Pr[X_i=1]","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"1+u\\le e^u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E e^{tX}=\\prod_{i=1}^m(1+p_i(e^t-1))\\le\\exp(\\mu(e^t-1)).","display":true},{"tex":"t>0","display":false},{"tex":"e^{tX}\\ge e^{t(1+\\delta)\\mu}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(\\mu(e^t-1)-t(1+\\delta)\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"t=\\ln(1+\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(-\\mu h_+(\\delta))","display":false},{"tex":"h_+(u)=(1+u)\\ln(1+u)-u","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le u\\le1","display":false},{"tex":"\\ln(1+u)\\ge2u/(2+u)\\ge2u/3","display":false},{"tex":"u^2/((1+u)(2+u)^2)\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"h_+(\\delta)=\\int_0^\\delta\\ln(1+u)\\,du\\ge\\delta^2/3","display":false},{"tex":"0<\\delta<1","display":false},{"tex":"t=\\ln(1-\\delta)<0","display":false},{"tex":"e^{tX}\\ge e^{t(1-\\delta)\\mu}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(-\\mu h_-(\\delta))","display":false},{"tex":"h_-(u)=u+(1-u)\\ln(1-u)","display":false},{"tex":"h_-(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"h_-^{\\prime}(u)=-\\ln(1-u)\\ge u","display":false},{"tex":"h_-(\\delta)\\ge\\delta^2/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=1","display":false},{"tex":"X=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_i(1-p_i)\\le e^{-\\mu}\\le e^{-\\mu/2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ln0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu=0","display":false}],"bytes":2948,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"放大与集中：[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]、[[28-thm-chernoff-bound]]、[[28-thm-bpp-closure]]。"},{"id":"1165db05a0a23506","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"R6 历史证据边界：当时本地常数推导已复核，但上游一般 Chernoff 尾界的矩母函数证明未完整独立审计，故当时不作为已完整核验的证明依赖。R7 已另行完成 [[28-thm-chernoff-bound]] 中有限独立比特的局部证明，以下有限放大推导因而有完整的本地证明依据；原书更一般的逆多项式优势放大证明仍未在本条独立审计。"}],"outgoing":[]}